Package: astal
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command-line client for Astal applications
 Astal is a library collection for building desktop shells.
 .
 This package contains the astal command, which talks to a running Astal
 application over its IPC socket.
